# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:16
translate italian suzybeachdate_e0e387e2:

    # "Suzy gets ready and we drive out to the beach together."
    "Suzy si prepara e andiamo insieme in macchina alla spiaggia."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:19
translate italian suzybeachdate_a4746763:

    # "We spend some time swimming around and chatting with each other."
    "Passiamo un po’ di tempo a nuotare e a chiacchierare tra di noi."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:22
translate italian suzybeachdate_da78be7b:

    # "The water is nice and she's just fun to be with."
    "L’acqua è piacevole ed è proprio divertente stare con lei."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:25
translate italian suzybeachdate_e8a06208:

    # "When we're both tired from swimming and the sun is starting to set, we sit on the beach together and eat the dinner that we packed."
    "Quando siamo entrambi stanchi di nuotare e il sole comincia a tramontare, ci sediamo insieme sulla spiaggia e mangiamo la cena che ci siamo portati."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:28
translate italian suzybeachdate_e615ede1:

    # "Then we lean back and talk for a while about whatever comes to mind."
    "Poi ci sdraiamo e chiacchieriamo per un po’ di qualsiasi cosa ci venga in mente."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:38
translate italian suzybeachdate_90f82d97:

    # "When the sun starts to set, we sit and watch it together, the sky growing darker and the air cooler."
    "Quando il sole comincia a tramontare, ci sediamo e lo guardiamo insieme, mentre il cielo si fa più scuro e l’aria più fresca."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:39
translate italian suzybeachdate_a8ff3746:

    # "Until the last ray of sunlight dips below the horizon."
    "Fino a quando l’ultimo raggio di sole non scompare sotto l’orizzonte."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:42
translate italian suzybeachdate_dd9441ef:

    # ss "That was beautiful."
    ss "È stato bellissimo."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:43
translate italian suzybeachdate_805db1af:

    # pc "You're beautiful."
    pc "Sei bellissima."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:44
translate italian suzybeachdate_68db0d5c:

    # ss "You're a dork. Let's go home."
    ss "Sei un idiota. Andiamo a casa."

# game/Scenes/Suzy/SuzyDates/suzybeachdate.rpy:47
translate italian suzybeachdate_7804a69a:

    # "We drive back home, both of us tired, Suzy dozing off against the window."
    "Torniamo a casa in macchina, entrambi stanchi, con Suzy che sonnecchia appoggiata al finestrino."

